{
"classname" "game_messagebox"
"targetname" "train_info"
"origin" "184 1122 328"
"title" "Train with a screen, a sign, a door and a camera"
"message" "The train is a func_tracktrain named train_main that runs on a loop of path_tracks. At each station a path_track fires a multi_manager, which stops the train, opens the door and sends the train on 8 seconds later. The door (func_door), the panel the screen is drawn on (a func_wall with a vgui_screen on it), the sign (point_worldtext), the camera (trigger_camera), the engine sound (ambient_generic), the lights (env_sprite), the wheel (momentary_rot_button), the buttons (func_button) and the spawn spots (info_player_go2) all have Move With set to train_main. The window frames are a momentary_door with Move With set to train_main, which follows the wheel as you turn it, and each pane of glass is a func_breakable with Move With set to the frames, so it rides on them and you can break it at any height. Every brush part that rides along has an origin brush, which is the point it turns around when the train turns. The Fed standing in the car has no Move With key, because monsters move on their own, but anything that stands on a moving object rides along with it, players too.\n\nPress the green Camera button to see the view from the camera on the train's roof for 10 seconds."
"distance" "220"
}
