"message" "The deck is a func_door_rotating named bridge_deck. The lamp (env_sprite), the mast, the railings, the sign and the lantern with its arm (func_wall) have Move With set to bridge_deck. The lantern also has Axis Locks (parentflags) set to 112, which keeps its pitch, yaw and roll, so it stays level while the deck tilts. The deck's origin brush sits on its hinge line at the north edge of the canal, and the deck turns around the X axis (flag 64), the line that runs through that brush from west to east. Every part on the deck has its own origin brush."
"distance" "220"
}
