{
"classname" "game_messagebox"
"targetname" "boat_info"
"origin" "1200 -1450 40"
"title" "Boat with a gun"
"message" "The boat is a func_tracktrain named boat, and it stops at the pier for 8 seconds on every lap. The gun (func_tank), its second barrel (a func_tank named in the gun's Extra Barrels key) and the controls (func_tankcontrols) have Move With set to boat, so how far the gun can turn is counted from the way the boat faces. Like every func_tank, the gun is built facing east, and its angles turn it to face the bow. Its Smoke Sprite and Flash Sprite keys make the smoke at each shot. The windshield (func_breakable) and the sign (func_wall) have Move With set to boat as well. The wake is an env_particle whose Move with entity is boat, and the thin smoke at the barrel is one whose Move with entity is the gun, which itself rides the boat. Every brush part that rides on the boat has an origin brush."
"distance" "220"
}
