{
"classname" "game_messagebox"
"targetname" "apache_info"
"origin" "1000 -1010 48"
"title" "Helicopter with a rope"
"message" "The helicopter is a monster_apache named rope_apache that flies a loop of path_corners above the roofs, and its Prisoner flag keeps it from ever attacking. Monsters can't have Move With, so the scientist is an env_sprite that shows models/scientist.mdl with its hanging sequence, and its Move With is set to rope_apache, which keeps it 200 units under the helicopter. The rope is an env_beam with the sprite sprites/rope.spr and the Draw Solid flag, from the helicopter to a small env_sprite at the scientist's hands, which rides on the helicopter too. If you shoot the helicopter down, its Trigger on death key fires three trigger_relays whose Kill Targets remove the scientist, the rope and the hook, and a trigger_hurt_remote that kills a real monster_scientist waiting in a closed box under the map, so the kill feed shows that you killed the scientist too."
"distance" "220"
}
